      },
      {
        "purpose": "分析第四象限及周期的单调性与波峰波谷规律",
        "reusable_items": [
          {
            "kind": "board_item",
            "board_kind": "math"
          }
        ],
        "moments": [
          {
            "narration": "现在，当动点旋转进入第四象限，也就是角度从二分之三 π 到 二 π 时，我们观察单位圆上动点的纵坐标变化。",
            "delivery": "patient",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "animate",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "number": 1,
                "end_value": 4.71,
                "duration_intent": "normal",
                "easing": "linear"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "随着角度继续增大到 二 π，点的高度从 lowest 的负 1 逐渐回升到 0，这表明正弦函数在区间 [3π/2, 2π] 上是单调递增的。",
            "delivery": "emphatic",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "animate",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "number": 1,
                "end_value": 6.28,
                "duration_intent": "extended",
                "easing": "linear"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "纵观整个圆周，从 0 到 二 π，纵坐标经历了‘上升到峰值 1、下降到谷底 -1、再次回升到 0’的过程，形成了完整的波峰与波谷周期循环。",
            "delivery": "encouraging",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "math",
                "timing": "after_speech",
                "content": {
                  "latex": "y = \\sin \\theta, \\quad \\theta \\in \\left[\\frac{3\\pi}{2}, 2\\pi\\right] \\uparrow"
